<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates</p>
<p>for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on</p>
<p>the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3898/03  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8450/60  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0787/97  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5092/02  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.16/17   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.2171/94  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1802.0/7.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.75/90  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.9000/50  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.5683/03  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0276/96  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.5870/80</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$326.90/40</p>
</text>
